<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Coastal Friends Mangalore successfully conducted the second edition of <strong>&#8220;Santwanada Sanchara 2.0 – A Day with Orphans&#8221;</strong> on December 14, 2024. The event, aimed at bringing joy and hope to orphaned children, was inaugurated by Mr. Anupam Agrawal, Police Commissioner of Mangalore, at BMS Hotel.</p>



