<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A total of 85 children, picked up from their homes and dropped back after the event, participated in this special day. Prior to the start of the event, Coastal Friends distributed uniforms to all participating children, ensuring they felt special and part of the day’s festivities. The event unfolded as follows:</p>



<ol class="wp-block-list">
<li><strong>Breakfast and Inauguration:</strong> The day began with a hearty breakfast, followed by the formal inauguration of the event.</li>



<li><strong>Pilikula Zoo and Exhibition:</strong> The children were taken to Pilikula, where they enjoyed a visit to the zoo and participated in an exhibition, experiencing nature and wildlife.</li>



<li><strong>Lunch at Umaiya Garden, Kutthar:</strong> The children then enjoyed a delicious lunch at Umaiya Garden, Kutthar, providing a relaxing break during their exciting day.</li>



<li><strong>Cultural Activities:</strong> Various cultural activities were held, showcasing the talents of the children and offering them an opportunity to express themselves.</li>



<li><strong>Competitions:</strong> Engaging competitions were organized, providing fun and fostering healthy competition among the children.</li>



<li><strong>Drawing Activities:</strong> The children participated in creative drawing activities, allowing them to explore their artistic side.</li>



<li><strong>Magic Show:</strong> A magical performance added excitement and wonder to the day, leaving the children amazed and delighted.</li>



<li><strong>Sports and Swimming:</strong> The children also enjoyed engaging in sports and swimming activities, offering them a chance to be active and have fun.</li>



<li><strong>Fun Stalls:</strong> The event featured small stalls reminiscent of childhood days, such as popcorn stalls and other treats, creating a nostalgic atmosphere for everyone.</li>
</ol>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Dancing and Singing:</strong> </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Coastal Friends members joined the children in dancing, singing, and performing memory games, creating a joyful and energetic atmosphere. Volunteers made every effort to fulfill the children&#8217;s wishes and ensure they enjoyed themselves to the fullest. The children also enjoyed performing various mimicry acts, adding to the fun of the day.</p>



