<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Coastal Friends Mangalore (R) Website launch</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A significant highlight of the day was the <strong>launch of the new Coastal Friends website</strong>, which was proudly unveiled by the children. In the presence of esteemed guests, the children had the honor of launching the website, symbolizing their importance in the initiative and making them an integral part of the celebration. The website launch added an extra layer of excitement to the day and was a proud moment for all involved.</p>



