<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Coastal Friends Bravery Award:</strong> </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">During the conclusion program, <strong>Master Abdul Khader Sawad</strong>, son of Zainudeen, Sunlight KC Road, was presented with the <strong>Coastal Friends Bravery Award</strong>. He was honored for his remarkable presence of mind and quick action, which served as an inspiration to all. His bravery demonstrated courage and responsibility beyond his years, and he truly deserves to be celebrated for his exemplary act.</p>



